{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788174323058,"sessionID":"ses_fa8815f1bffeeE6hC19uqKKiGR","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_01a0577ecc7a7b22adace3e211c3d447","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/docs/director/CURRENT-TASK.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/docs/director/CURRENT-TASK.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # CURRENT TASK\n2: \n3: ## ID\n4: `FG-GREENFIELD-001`\n5: \n6: ## STATUS\n7: `IMPLEMENTATION`\n8: \n9: Active implementation is authorized because `docs/director/FULL-GAME-STATUS.md`\n10: contains the independently reviewed marker `FULL_GAME_GATE_A=PASS`.\n11: \n12: ## SUPERSESSION\n13: \n14: This full-game task supersedes `BKR-GREENFIELD-001` and every bunker-only stop\n15: condition. The bunker-only packet and its records are historical evidence only.\n16: Future agents must not resume that mission, its staging checklist, or its old\n17: `DIRECTOR_REVIEW` boundary.\n18: \n19: ## ROLE\n20: \n21: Director / Orchestrator coordinating Gameplay Systems Architecture, World /\n22: Environment Art, UI/UX, Technical QA, Gameplay/UX QA, Visual QA, and integration.\n23: \n24: ## AUTHORITY\n25: \n26: The human Director instruction received on 2026-08-26 authorizes complete\n27: retirement and replacement of the current playable game implementation while\n28: preserving engineering and recovery infrastructure. Filesystem + Rojo are the\n29: permanent source of truth. Permanent Studio-only changes are forbidden.\n30: \n31: ## RECOVERY GATE\n32: \n33: - Immutable backup: `backups/full_game/20260826_174739_pre_full_greenfield_rebuild/`\n34: - Manifest: `backups/full_game/20260826_174739_pre_full_greenfield_rebuild/BACKUP_MANIFEST.md`\n35: - 1,043 files / 6,179,507,194 bytes verified source-before == backup == source-after.\n36: - Backup and evidence are read-only with macOS `uchg` flags.\n37: - Marker: `FULL_GAME_BACKUP=PASS`\n38: \n39: No destructive retirement is permitted if this recovery evidence is missing or\n40: fails re-verification.\n41: \n42: ## GOAL\n43: \n44: Deliver a cohesive, creepy, multiplayer-safe survival game from one clean\n45: source-controlled architecture. The integrated player loop is:\n46: \n47: `wake -> gather -> farm/process -> fortify/progress -> survive night -> recover`\n48: \n49: Required player-usable content includes:\n50: \n51: - canonical safe spawn and stable ground at the documented world datum;\n52: - deliberately authored exterior, navigation, landmarks, and bunker/facility;\n53: - onboarding and unified HUD/input presentation;\n54: - Axe -> Tree -> Wood harvesting through canonical inventory;\n55: - farming and FoodProcessor loop;\n56: - server-authoritative zombie combat and day/night survival loop;\n57: - Credits economy, Scrap exchange, shop, storage, power, and upgrades;\n58: - lighting, atmosphere, audio, restrained VFX, and performance budgets;\n59: - authoritative contracts safe for up to six concurrent players.\n60: \n61: ## AUTHORITATIVE RECORDS\n62: \n63: - `docs/director/FULL-GAME-GREENFIELD-REBUILD.md`\n64: - `docs/director/FULL-GAME-STATUS.md`\n65: - `docs/director/FULL-GAME-CONTRACTS.md`\n66: - `docs/director/FULL-GAME-MIGRATION-MANIFEST.md`\n67: - `docs/roadmap/FULL-GAME-ROADMAP.md`\n68: - `docs/agents/task-packets/FG-GREENFIELD-001.md`\n69: - `docs/agents/FULL-GAME-OWNERSHIP.md`\n70: \n71: ## REQUIRED SEQUENCE\n72: \n73: 1. Keep the immutable backup valid and record prior interrupted progress.\n74: 2. Freeze full-game contracts, ownership, migration boundary, coordinates,\n75:    tuning, and acceptance gates.\n76: 3. Retire legacy writers/content only through controlled mapped source scopes.\n77: 4. Build the spawn/world/bunker foundation first.\n78: 5. Build vertically through inventory/resources, farming/processor/economy,\n79:    combat/zombies/time, UI/onboarding, and presentation.\n80: 6. Validate every changed Luau file, deterministic builders, canonical Rojo\n81:    sourcemap/build, project workflows, and actual mapped success conditions.\n82: 7. Run controlled Play regressions and always return Studio to Edit-only.\n83: 8. Produce canonical OBS evidence while never modifying Streamlabs.\n84: 9. Pass independent Technical, Gameplay/UX, and Visual review. Resolve findings\n85:    or record genuine Director-only visual judgments.\n86: 10. Set this task status and the durable checkpoint to exactly\n87:     `DIRECTOR_REVIEW`, provide the evidence summary, and stop.\n88: \n89: ## STOP CONDITION\n90: \n91: Do not stop at an intermediate phase. Stop only for a genuine human-only blocker\n92: or when the complete rebuilt game and evidence package reach exactly\n93: `DIRECTOR_REVIEW`. Do not claim human or pixel-level visual approval.\n\n(End of file - total 93 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# CURRENT TASK\n\n## ID\n`FG-GREENFIELD-001`\n\n## STATUS\n`IMPLEMENTATION`\n\nActive implementation is authorized because `docs/director/FULL-GAME-STATUS.md`\ncontains the independently reviewed marker `FULL_GAME_GATE_A=PASS`.\n\n## SUPERSESSION\n\nThis full-game task supersedes `BKR-GREENFIELD-001` and every bunker-only stop\ncondition. The bunker-only packet and its records are historical evidence only.\nFuture agents must not resume that mission, its staging checklist, or its old\n`DIRECTOR_REVIEW` boundary.\n\n## ROLE\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/docs/director/CURRENT-TASK.md","text":"# CURRENT TASK\n\n## ID\n`FG-GREENFIELD-001`\n\n## STATUS\n`IMPLEMENTATION`\n\nActive implementation is authorized because `docs/director/FULL-GAME-STATUS.md`\ncontains the independently reviewed marker `FULL_GAME_GATE_A=PASS`.\n\n## SUPERSESSION\n\nThis full-game task supersedes `BKR-GREENFIELD-001` and every bunker-only stop\ncondition. The bunker-only packet and its records are historical evidence only.\nFuture agents must not resume that mission, its staging checklist, or its old\n`DIRECTOR_REVIEW` boundary.\n\n## ROLE\n\nDirector / Orchestrator coordinating Gameplay Systems Architecture, World /\nEnvironment Art, UI/UX, Technical QA, Gameplay/UX QA, Visual QA, and integration.\n\n## AUTHORITY\n\nThe human Director instruction received on 2026-08-26 authorizes complete\nretirement and replacement of the current playable game implementation while\npreserving engineering and recovery infrastructure. Filesystem + Rojo are the\npermanent source of truth. Permanent Studio-only changes are forbidden.\n\n## RECOVERY GATE\n\n- Immutable backup: `backups/full_game/20260826_174739_pre_full_greenfield_rebuild/`\n- Manifest: `backups/full_game/20260826_174739_pre_full_greenfield_rebuild/BACKUP_MANIFEST.md`\n- 1,043 files / 6,179,507,194 bytes verified source-before == backup == source-after.\n- Backup and evidence are read-only with macOS `uchg` flags.\n- Marker: `FULL_GAME_BACKUP=PASS`\n\nNo destructive retirement is permitted if this recovery evidence is missing or\nfails re-verification.\n\n## GOAL\n\nDeliver a cohesive, creepy, multiplayer-safe survival game from one clean\nsource-controlled architecture. The integrated player loop is:\n\n`wake -> gather -> farm/process -> fortify/progress -> survive night -> recover`\n\nRequired player-usable content includes:\n\n- canonical safe spawn and stable ground at the documented world datum;\n- deliberately authored exterior, navigation, landmarks, and bunker/facility;\n- onboarding and unified HUD/input presentation;\n- Axe -> Tree -> Wood harvesting through canonical inventory;\n- farming and FoodProcessor loop;\n- server-authoritative zombie combat and day/night survival loop;\n- Credits economy, Scrap exchange, shop, storage, power, and upgrades;\n- lighting, atmosphere, audio, restrained VFX, and performance budgets;\n- authoritative contracts safe for up to six concurrent players.\n\n## AUTHORITATIVE RECORDS\n\n- `docs/director/FULL-GAME-GREENFIELD-REBUILD.md`\n- `docs/director/FULL-GAME-STATUS.md`\n- `docs/director/FULL-GAME-CONTRACTS.md`\n- `docs/director/FULL-GAME-MIGRATION-MANIFEST.md`\n- `docs/roadmap/FULL-GAME-ROADMAP.md`\n- `docs/agents/task-packets/FG-GREENFIELD-001.md`\n- `docs/agents/FULL-GAME-OWNERSHIP.md`\n\n## REQUIRED SEQUENCE\n\n1. Keep the immutable backup valid and record prior interrupted progress.\n2. Freeze full-game contracts, ownership, migration boundary, coordinates,\n   tuning, and acceptance gates.\n3. Retire legacy writers/content only through controlled mapped source scopes.\n4. Build the spawn/world/bunker foundation first.\n5. Build vertically through inventory/resources, farming/processor/economy,\n   combat/zombies/time, UI/onboarding, and presentation.\n6. Validate every changed Luau file, deterministic builders, canonical Rojo\n   sourcemap/build, project workflows, and actual mapped success conditions.\n7. Run controlled Play regressions and always return Studio to Edit-only.\n8. Produce canonical OBS evidence while never modifying Streamlabs.\n9. Pass independent Technical, Gameplay/UX, and Visual review. Resolve findings\n   or record genuine Director-only visual judgments.\n10. Set this task status and the durable checkpoint to exactly\n    `DIRECTOR_REVIEW`, provide the evidence summary, and stop.\n\n## STOP CONDITION\n\nDo not stop at an intermediate phase. Stop only for a genuine human-only blocker\nor when the complete rebuilt game and evidence package reach exactly\n`DIRECTOR_REVIEW`. Do not claim human or pixel-level visual approval.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":93,"totalLines":93,"truncated":false}},"title":"BunkerGame/docs/director/CURRENT-TASK.md","time":{"start":1788174323029,"end":1788174323053}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_01a0577ecc7a7b22adace3e211c3d447"}},"id":"prt_0577ecc2b001i7Gss34gdyYmNG","sessionID":"ses_fa8815f1bffeeE6hC19uqKKiGR","messageID":"msg_0577ea807001QuHE3yThvhK6AM"}}
