{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788174345357,"sessionID":"ses_fa8815f1bffeeE6hC19uqKKiGR","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_01a0577f22ea7282a9825cac299b8613","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/docs/director/TECH-BIBLE.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/docs/director/TECH-BIBLE.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # BunkerGame — Technical Bible\n2: \n3: ## Authority\n4: \n5: Server owns trusted gameplay state.\n6: \n7: Client owns:\n8: - presentation\n9: - input\n10: - UI\n11: - camera effects\n12: - non-authoritative visual feedback\n13: \n14: ## Source of Truth\n15: \n16: Filesystem + Rojo project.\n17: \n18: ## Rojo Mapping\n19: \n20: Always read `default.project.json` before making assumptions about filesystem-to-Roblox mappings.\n21: \n22: Do not invent mappings.\n23: \n24: ## BDS 4\n25: \n26: Available commands:\n27: - bds doctor\n28: - bds inspect\n29: - bds ast <file>\n30: - bds review project\n31: - bds review all\n32: \n33: Do not use:\n34: - bds analyze\n35: - bds file\n36: - bds range\n37: \n38: These commands do not exist in the current BDS 4 installation.\n39: \n40: ## Workflow\n41: \n42: Before implementation:\n43: \n44: tools/workflows/preflight.sh\n45: \n46: After implementation:\n47: - run bds ast on every changed Luau file\n48: - run tools/workflows/postflight.sh\n49: \n50: ## Evidence Policy\n51: \n52: Never invent:\n53: - files\n54: - RemoteEvents\n55: - APIs\n56: - ModuleScripts\n57: - assets\n58: - Rojo mappings\n59: \n60: Uninspected RBXM content must be labeled:\n61: \n62: UNVERIFIED_BINARY\n63: \n64: ## Implementation Rule\n65: \n66: When a technical specification exists in docs/director, execute it rather than redesigning it.\n67: \n68: If the specification conflicts with verified project evidence:\n69: - stop\n70: - show the evidence\n71: - report the conflict\n72: - do not improvise\n\n(End of file - total 72 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# BunkerGame — Technical Bible\n\n## Authority\n\nServer owns trusted gameplay state.\n\nClient owns:\n- presentation\n- input\n- UI\n- camera effects\n- non-authoritative visual feedback\n\n## Source of Truth\n\nFilesystem + Rojo project.\n\n## Rojo Mapping\n\nAlways read `default.project.json` before making assumptions about filesystem-to-Roblox mappings.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/docs/director/TECH-BIBLE.md","text":"# BunkerGame — Technical Bible\n\n## Authority\n\nServer owns trusted gameplay state.\n\nClient owns:\n- presentation\n- input\n- UI\n- camera effects\n- non-authoritative visual feedback\n\n## Source of Truth\n\nFilesystem + Rojo project.\n\n## Rojo Mapping\n\nAlways read `default.project.json` before making assumptions about filesystem-to-Roblox mappings.\n\nDo not invent mappings.\n\n## BDS 4\n\nAvailable commands:\n- bds doctor\n- bds inspect\n- bds ast <file>\n- bds review project\n- bds review all\n\nDo not use:\n- bds analyze\n- bds file\n- bds range\n\nThese commands do not exist in the current BDS 4 installation.\n\n## Workflow\n\nBefore implementation:\n\ntools/workflows/preflight.sh\n\nAfter implementation:\n- run bds ast on every changed Luau file\n- run tools/workflows/postflight.sh\n\n## Evidence Policy\n\nNever invent:\n- files\n- RemoteEvents\n- APIs\n- ModuleScripts\n- assets\n- Rojo mappings\n\nUninspected RBXM content must be labeled:\n\nUNVERIFIED_BINARY\n\n## Implementation Rule\n\nWhen a technical specification exists in docs/director, execute it rather than redesigning it.\n\nIf the specification conflicts with verified project evidence:\n- stop\n- show the evidence\n- report the conflict\n- do not improvise","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":72,"totalLines":72,"truncated":false}},"title":"BunkerGame/docs/director/TECH-BIBLE.md","time":{"start":1788174345304,"end":1788174345352}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_01a0577f22ea7282a9825cac299