{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788174373533,"sessionID":"ses_fa8815f1bffeeE6hC19uqKKiGR","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a0577f905477529d5adc27cafd977c","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"ls -R artifacts/sol-gate1-golden-reference 2>&1 | head -n 100; echo \"---\"; cat artifacts/sol-gate1-golden-reference/*.md 2>&1 | head -n 100; echo \"---\"; ls -la tools/workflows/ 2>&1"},"output":"README.md\nSOL_GATE1_GOLDEN_REFERENCE.build.luau\nevidence\n\nartifacts/sol-gate1-golden-reference/evidence:\nA_initial.jpg\nB_dogleg.jpg\nC_reveal.jpg\nD_player_scale.jpg\nE_three_quarter.jpg\nF_side_silhouette.jpg\nreveal-pass\n\nartifacts/sol-gate1-golden-reference/evidence/reveal-pass:\nA_initial.jpg\nB_before_dogleg.jpg\nC_reveal.jpg\nD_player_scale_entrance.jpg\nE_three_quarter.jpg\nF_side_silhouette.jpg\n---\n# SOL Gate 1 Golden Reference\n\nThis is the isolated, non-production v36 spatial teaching reference for Gate 1 macro composition and reveal hierarchy.\n\n- Studio root: `Workspace.SOL_GATE1_GOLDEN_REFERENCE`\n- Reference bounds: X `780..980`, Y `20..110`, Z `-80..120`\n- Production mapping: none; `artifacts/` is outside the production `src/Workspace` Rojo mapping.\n- Durable reconstruction: `SOL_GATE1_GOLDEN_REFERENCE.build.luau`\n- Initial macro evidence: `evidence/A_initial.jpg` through `evidence/F_side_silhouette.jpg`\n- Focused reveal-pass evidence: `evidence/reveal-pass/A_initial.jpg` through `evidence/reveal-pass/F_side_silhouette.jpg`\n\nThe reference uses one analytic terrain heightfield rather than disconnected terrain balls. A terrain-surfaced dogleg changes heading before a terrain-held late reveal. The buried facility now reads through a heavier asymmetric portal, a compact retaining cheek, exposed structural contact edges, a descending entry slab, layered inner compression frame, and a deep bounded darkness volume. The bunker shell remains concealed. Sparse, distorted dead pines establish asymmetric foreground framing and a creepy ridge rhythm without becoming vegetation dressing.\n\nThis artifact is a teaching example, not production content. Do not promote or copy it into `GameWorld` without Human Director approval. Its builder refuses to overwrite an existing reference and refuses to run if a production `GameWorld` BasePart overlaps the isolated bounds.\n---\ntotal 88\ndrwxr-xr-x@  8 Ori  staff    256 Aug 26 22:56 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 15 Ori  staff    480 Aug 31 12:17 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 Ori  staff    128 Aug 27 00:56 __pycache__\n-rw-r--r--@  1 Ori  staff  16561 Aug 27 00:55 cutover_full_game.py\n-rwxr-xr-x@  1 Ori  staff    705 Aug 26 23:07 postflight.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x@  1 Ori  staff    739 Aug 26 23:07 preflight.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x@  1 Ori  staff   2782 Aug 26 23:07 run-current-task.sh\n-rw-r--r--@  1 Ori  staff  12201 Aug 26 23:01 validate_full_game_candidate.py\n","metadata":{"output":"README.md\nSOL_GATE1_GOLDEN_REFERENCE.build.luau\nevidence\n\nartifacts/sol-gate1-golden-reference/evidence:\nA_initial.jpg\nB_dogleg.jpg\nC_reveal.jpg\nD_player_scale.jpg\nE_three_quarter.jpg\nF_side_silhouette.jpg\nreveal-pass\n\nartifacts/sol-gate1-golden-reference/evidence/reveal-pass:\nA_initial.jpg\nB_before_dogleg.jpg\nC_reveal.jpg\nD_player_scale_entrance.jpg\nE_three_quarter.jpg\nF_side_silhouette.jpg\n---\n# SOL Gate 1 Golden Reference\n\nThis is the isolated, non-production v36 spatial teaching reference for Gate 1 macro composition and reveal hierarchy.\n\n- Studio root: `Workspace.SOL_GATE1_GOLDEN_REFERENCE`\n- Reference bounds: X `780..980`, Y `20..110`, Z `-80..120`\n- Production mapping: none; `artifacts/` is outside the production `src/Workspace` Rojo mapping.\n- Durable reconstruction: `SOL_GATE1_GOLDEN_REFERENCE.build.luau`\n- Initial macro evidence: `evidence/A_initial.jpg` through `evidence/F_side_silhouette.jpg`\n- Focused reveal-pass evidence: `evidence/reveal-pass/A_initial.jpg` through `evidence/reveal-pass/F_side_silhouette.jpg`\n\nThe reference uses one analytic terrain heightfield rather than disconnected terrain balls. A terrain-surfaced dogleg changes heading before a terrain-held late reveal. The buried facility now reads through a heavier asymmetric portal, a compact retaining cheek, exposed structural contact edges, a descending entry slab, layered inner compression frame, and a deep bounded darkness volume. The bunker shell remains concealed. Sparse, distorted dead pines establish asymmetric foreground framing and a creepy ridge rhythm without becoming vegetation dressing.\n\nThis artifact is a teaching example, not production content. Do not promote or copy it into `GameWorld` without Human Director approval. Its builder refuses to overwrite an existing reference and refuses to run if a production `GameWorld` BasePart overlaps the isolated bounds.\n---\ntotal 88\ndrwxr-xr-x@  8 Ori  staff    256 Aug 26 22:56 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 15 Ori  staff    480 Aug 31 12:17 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 Ori  staff    128 Aug 27 00:56 __pycache__\n-rw-r--r--@  1 Ori  staff  16561 Aug 27 00:55 cutover_full_game.py\n-rwxr-xr-x@  1 Ori  staff    705 Aug 26 23:07 postflight.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x@  1 Ori  staff    739 Aug 26 23:07 preflight.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x@  1 Ori  staff   2782 Aug 26 23:07 run-current-task.sh\n-rw-r--r--@  1 Ori  staff  12201 Aug 26 23:01 validate_full_game_candidate.py\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"ls -R artifacts/sol-gate1-golden-reference 2>&1 | head -n 100; echo \"---\"; cat artifacts/sol-gate1-golden-reference/*.md 2>&1 | head -n 100; echo \"---\"; ls -la tools/workflows/ 2>&1","time":{"start":1788174373526,"end":1788174373530}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_01a0577f905477529d5adc27cafd977c"}},"id":"prt_0577f9205001qBSs5yCuPgWw0U","sessionID":"ses_fa8815f1bffeeE6hC19uqKKiGR","messageID":"msg_0577f8ae9001BeG2AXwTCV0EXJ"}}
