{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788178627519,"sessionID":"ses_fa8815f1bffeeE6hC19uqKKiGR","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_01a057b97e8378229981a248d76ddb78","state":{"status":"error","input":{"description":"Terrain specialist spec","prompt":"You are bunkergame-terrain-specialist. Convert spatial intent into implementable terrain field and Roblox Terrain construction spec.\n\nSPATIAL CONTEXT:\n- Dominant ridge behind bunker center (-20,68,50) extent X -120..100 Z 30..180 peak Y78-88, embedded bunker at X -62..58 Z14..158.\n- Need rolling elevation, ridges, valleys, berms, overlooks, traversal corridors, irregular silhouettes, terrain occlusion, natural bunker embedment.\n- Bounds playable -320..320, -240..400, datum Y54, StableGround 640x640 at Y52.5.\n- Must avoid giant slabs, repetitive wedges, evenly spaced hills, visible seams.\n\nProvide:\n- Terrain heightfield approach (how to represent in filesystem JSON: use Parts Wedge vs Terrain voxel).\n- Specific terrain masses with centers, dimensions, elevations, slopes (30-35 deg), interpenetration for gaps, grounding checks.\n- Occlusion relationships and negative volumes preserved.\n- Validation criteria.\n\nOutput terrain spec ready for builder. End with TERRAIN_SPEC_READY=YES if complete.","subagent_type":"bunkergame-terrain-specialist"},"error":"Subagent failed (task_id: ses_fa84668e4ffeIzHGSWkcIhlPeT): The user rejected permission to use this specific tool call.","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_fa8815f1bffeeE6hC19uqKKiGR","sessionId":"ses_fa84668e4ffeIzHGSWkcIhlPeT","model":{"providerID":"ollama","modelID":"qwen-spatial"}},"time":{"start":1788178175778,"end":1788178627508}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_01a057b97e8378229981a248d76ddb78"}},"id":"prt_057b97ef3001wRA4ep4Bh5fziH","sessionID":"ses_fa8815f1bffeeE6hC19uqKKiGR","messageID":"msg_057b9214b001UjQeSLCnyYgXqM"}}
